# AI-assistant scratch/working notes (ephemeral by design; anything worth
# keeping gets promoted into AGENTS.md, which stays tracked). See AGENTS.md
# "Posit Assistant Configuration" for the policy this replaced.
.posit/

# Override a global ~/.gitignore rule ("test-*") that would otherwise hide
# every testthat file in this repo (tests/testthat/test-*.R is the standard
# testthat naming convention). See AGENTS.md for the 2026-08-01 discovery
# that test-clean.R went untracked for this reason.
!/tests/testthat/test-*

# Same global "test-*" rule also silently hid .github/workflows/test-coverage.yaml
# (discovered 2026-08-02, third occurrence of this bug class -- see AGENTS.md).
!/.github/workflows/test-*
